         </dc:creator>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Operation Sharpshooter</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The McAfee Advanced Threat Research team and McAfee Labs Malware Operations Group, employing McAfee Global Threat Intelligence, have discovered a new global campaign targeting nuclear, defense, energy, and financial companies. This campaign, Operation Sharpshooter, leverages an in-memory implant to download and retrieve a second-stage implantâ€”which we call Rising Sunâ€”for further exploitation.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <xmp:CreateDate>2018-12-06T16:18:44-07:00</xmp:CreateDate>
